+    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
+    # Busy-session controls (per-message inline buttons + reactions)
+    #
+    # Default implementations are no-ops so platforms without inline-UI
+    # support (Matrix, Feishu, DingTalk, WhatsApp, iMessage…) inherit
