  2590	
  2591	        The upstream ack starts as "⏳ Queued for the next turn..." which
  2592	        is correct for the default queue path but misleading after a
  2593	        Steer / Interrupt / Stop tap.  Rewriting it makes the chat
  2594	        history readable: "⏩ Steered..." / "⚡ Interrupted..." / "🛑 Stopped."
