 11761	
 11762	        Both _last_activity_ts and _last_activity_desc are only reset for
 11763	        fresh external turns (depth 0); they are semantically paired —
 11764	        desc describes the activity *at* ts, so updating one without the
 11765	        other would make get_activity_summary() misleading.
 11766	        For interrupt-recursive turns both are preserved so the inactivity
 11767	        watchdog can accumulate stuck-turn idle time and fire the 30-min
 11768	        timeout (#15654).  The depth-0 reset is still needed: a session
 11769	        idle for 29 min would otherwise trip the watchdog before the new
